    "probe_text": "Here is the complete, ordered list of everything applied when creating an owner via **POST `/api/owners`** (handled by `OwnerRestControllerV1.addOwner`, `src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/controller/v1/OwnerRestControllerV1.java:124`).\n\n## Before the method body runs\n\n1. **Security check** \u2014 `@PreAuthorize(\"hasRole(@roles.OWNER_ADMIN)\")` (line 122). Missing role \u2192 403.\n2. **Bean Validation on the request DTO** (`OwnerFieldsDto`, triggered by `@Valid`/`@Validated`). Any violation \u2192 **400** (`MethodArgumentNotValidException`, mapped by `ExceptionControllerAdvice`):\n   - `firstName` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Pattern` (letters, up to 3 words), `@Size(1..30)`\n   - `lastName` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Pattern` (letters, optional trailing `.`), `@Size(1..30)`\n   - `address` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Pattern` (non-blank), `@Size(1..255)`\n   - `city` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Pattern` (non-blank), `@Size(1..80)`\n   - `telephone` \u2014 `@NotNull`, `@Size(1..20)`\n   - `email` \u2014 `@Size(max 255)`, `@Email`\n   - `postcode` \u2014 `@Pattern(\"^[0-9]{4}$\")`\n   - `registrationDate` / `birthDate` \u2014 `@Valid`\n\n*(No custom interceptors/filters exist. The `Owner`/`Person` entity's own `@NotEmpty`/`@Pattern` annotations are NOT re-checked here \u2014 the controller never applies `@Valid` to the entity.)*\n\n## Inside the method body (in order)\n\n3. **Map DTO \u2192 entity** \u2014 `ownerMapper.toOwner(...)`; `id` and `pets` ignored; `sharesHousehold` not mapped.\n4. **Normalize address** \u2014 trim/collapse whitespace, uppercase, expand `ST\u2192STREET`, `RD\u2192ROAD`, `AVE\u2192AVENUE`. Empty result \u2192 **400**.\n5. **Normalize telephone to E.164** \u2014 strip separators; `+` kept, leading `0`\u2192`+61`, else `+1`; must be 8\u201315 digits and pass national-length check (+61 \u21d2 9, +1 \u21d2 10). Null result \u2192 **400**.\n6. **Normalize email** (if present) \u2014 trim, syntactic regex, lowercase, reject disposable domains (`mailinator.com`, `tempmail.com`, `guerrillamail.com`). Invalid \u2192 **400**.\n7. **Validate postcode** (if present) \u2014 4 digits and within region range derived from city (NSW 2000\u20132099 / VIC 3000\u20133099 / QLD 4000\u20134099). Invalid \u2192 **400**.\n8. **Registration date defaulting** \u2014 null \u2192 `today`; future date \u2192 **400**; then roll off weekends to next business day (Sat +2, Sun +1).\n9. **City capacity check** \u2014 `countOwnersInCity(city)` (case-insensitive full scan); `\u2265 50` \u2192 **409 CONFLICT**.\n10. **Daily capacity check** \u2014 `countOwnersRegisteredOn(registrationDate)`; `\u2265 100` \u2192 **429 TOO_MANY_REQUESTS**.\n11. **Household handling** (only if postcode present) \u2014 compute `householdId` = first 12 hex of SHA-256 of `lastName|postcode`; set on entity. If an existing owner already occupies that household and `sharesHousehold` \u2260 TRUE \u2192 **409**; if opted in \u2192 mark `declaredHouseholdMember = true`.\n12. **Hard duplicate check** \u2014 build `identityKey = telephone|email|householdId`; compare against every existing owner. Match \u2192 **409**.\n13. **Soft duplicate flag** \u2014 if declared household member \u2192 `possibleDuplicate = false`; otherwise set `possibleDuplicate = true` and `possibleDuplicateOf` = lowest-id owner sharing last name + postcode but different telephone.\n14. **Set `customerCode`** \u2014 `<REGION>-<HASH8>` (REGION from postcode; HASH8 = first 8 hex of SHA-256 of `telephone+lastName`).\n15. **Set `membershipNumber`** \u2014 `<customerCode>-M<YY>` (YY = registration year mod 100).\n16. **Set `namesakeCount`** \u2014 count of existing owners with same first+last name (case-insensitive).\n\n## Persistence\n\n17. **Save** \u2014 `clinicService.saveOwner(owner)` (`@Transactional`) \u2192 `ownerRepository.save(...)` \u2192 `em.persist` (INSERT, id via `@GeneratedValue IDENTITY`). `pets` would cascade-persist (none on create). No `@PrePersist`/`@EntityListeners`/JPA auditing.\n\n## After save (response assembly side-effects)\n\n18. **Map entity \u2192 DTO** \u2014 derives response-only fields: `displayName`, `initials`, `locality`, `contactPreference` (EMAIL if email else PHONE), `telephoneDisplay`, `identityKey`, `checkDigit` (Luhn), `ageBand`.\n19. **Apply membership** \u2014 compute `membershipPoints`/`membershipLevel` (+2 email, +1 no namesakes, +2 household \u22653, +3 tenure >365 days; level 1\u20134; household size from a full owner scan).\n20. **Audit log side-effect** \u2014 `AUDIT` logger emits one INFO line: `owner created: id=\u2026 customerCode=\u2026 registrationDate=\u2026 membershipLevel=\u2026`.\n21. **Set `bulkSignupWarning`** \u2014 true when >80 owners already registered for today's business day.\n22. **Set `Location` header** \u2192 `/api/owners/{id}`; return **201 CREATED**.\n\n## Explicitly absent\nNo password hashing (owners have no password), no events published, no emails/notifications, no cache updates, and no external network calls. The only happy-path logging is the single `AUDIT.info` line; the repeated `findAllOwners()` in-memory scans back the duplicate/capacity checks."
